    "text": "Alvin Sun Advertiser\nwebsite\nAlvin\nAlvin Council discusses flood mitigation grant\nBy Kim Bitner Ford Contributing Writer,\n6 hours agoA special session of the Alvin City Council convened on June 26 to deliberate an agreement with GFT Engineering for design engineering services. The services are related to the Texas General Land Office Community Development and Revitalization Grant for flood and drainage improvements along Durant Street and the M-1 culvert crossing replacement and improvements at South Street.",
